+
+```diff
+--- /dev/null
++++ src/main/resources/application-local.yml
+@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
++spring:
++  datasource:
++    url: jdbc:h2:mem:testdb
++    driver-class-name: org.h2.Driver
++    username: sa
++    password: password
++  h2:
++    console:
++      enabled: true
++  jpa:
++    hibernate:
++      ddl-auto: update
++    show-sql: true
+```
+
+### 2. Modify `application.yml` to be used for the stage environment
+
