```diff
--- example.txt
+++ example.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
-first line
+first line updated
 second line
 third line
```

Second diff (should be ignored):

```diff
--- example.txt
+++ example.txt
@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@
 second line
+second line updated
 third line
```
"""

