def test_salvage_correct_hunks_with_multiple_diffs_same_file():
    """
    Test that salvage_correct_hunks works correctly when chat contains
    multiple diffs for the same file, preventing KeyError.
    
    This reproduces the exact error from issue #1197.
    """
    # Create a mock memory object
    class MockMemory:
        def __init__(self):
            self.history = []
        
        def add(self, item):
            self.history.append(item)
    
    memory = MockMemory()
    
    # Original files (simulating the Java Spring Boot project)
    original_files = FilesDict({
        "src/main/resources/application.yml": """spring:
  datasource:
    url: jdbc:postgresql://<RDS_ENDPOINT>:5432/<DB_NAME>
    username: <DB_USERNAME>
    password: <DB_PASSWORD>
    driver-class-name: org.postgresql.Driver
  jpa:
    hibernate:
      ddl-auto: update
    show-sql: true
    properties:
      hibernate:
        format_sql: true
""",
        "run.sh": """#!/bin/bash
# Run script for stage environment
java -jar app.jar --spring.profiles.active=stage
"""
    })
    
    # Create the chat message with multiple diffs for application.yml
    # This simulates the problematic chat from the issue
    chat_content = """
I want to separate different environment, stage environment and local environment, current setting is for stage, so I need a new yaml config for local, and this local environment I want to use H2 DB. So yaml file will have two, and run.sh I also want two for different env.

```diff
--- src/main/resources/application.yml
+++ src/main/resources/application.yml
@@ -1,13 +1,13 @@
 spring:
   datasource:
-    url: jdbc:postgresql://<RDS_ENDPOINT>:5432/<DB_NAME>
-    username: <DB_USERNAME>
-    password: <DB_PASSWORD>
+    url: jdbc:postgresql://stage-rds-endpoint:5432/stage_db
+    username: stage_user
+    password: stage_password
     driver-class-name: org.postgresql.Driver
   jpa:
     hibernate:
       ddl-auto: update
     show-sql: true
     properties:
       hibernate:
         format_sql: true
```

```diff
--- /dev/null
+++ src/main/resources/application-local.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+spring:
+  datasource:
+    url: jdbc:h2:mem:testdb
+    driver-class-name: org.h2.Driver
+    username: sa
+    password: password
+  h2:
+    console:
+      enabled: true
+  jpa:
+    hibernate:
+      ddl-auto: update
+    show-sql: true
```

```diff
--- src/main/resources/application.yml
+++ src/main/resources/application-stage.yml
@@ -1,13 +1,15 @@
 spring:
   profiles:
-    active: stage
+    active: stage
   datasource:
-    url: jdbc:postgresql://<RDS_ENDPOINT>:5432/<DB_NAME>
-    username: <DB_USERNAME>
-    password: <DB_PASSWORD>
+    url: jdbc:postgresql://stage-rds-endpoint:5432/stage_db
+    username: stage_user
+    password: stage_password
     driver-class-name: org.postgresql.Driver
   jpa:
